WEBVTT

1
00:01:33.833 --> 00:01:36.750
In these verses, Lord Krishna is explaining

2
00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:38.791
how He pervades

3
00:01:38.791 --> 00:01:40.208
this entire universe

4
00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:43.000
and how this entire creation

5
00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.791
depends on Him.

6
00:01:49.666 --> 00:01:52.750
Now from the eighth verse

7
00:01:52.750 --> 00:01:55.916
to the eleventh verse of the seventh chapter,

8
00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:57.958
Lord Krishna gives fourteen examples.

9
00:01:57.958 --> 00:01:59.750
These examples explain

10
00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:03.500
how the entire creation is established on Him,

11
00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:06.750
just as pearls are strung on a thread.

12
00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:10.166
First example – Raso 'ham apsu –

13
00:02:10.166 --> 00:02:13.333
meaning 'I am the taste of water.'

14
00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:15.916
Water preserves life,

15
00:02:15.916 --> 00:02:19.083
and a basic element of this water is its taste.

16
00:02:19.083 --> 00:02:21.833
This taste that quenches thirst,

17
00:02:21.833 --> 00:02:23.125
this taste that provides satisfaction

18
00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:24.958
upon drinking water.

19
00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:27.000
This taste is Lord Krishna,

20
00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.291
meaning this taste

21
00:02:28.291 --> 00:02:31.000
is a form of His power.

22
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:34.541
Second example – Prabhāsmi śaśi-sūryayoḥ –

23
00:02:34.541 --> 00:02:38.500
meaning 'I am the light of the sun and moon.'

24
00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:42.125
The sun's light provides warmth and energy,

25
00:02:42.125 --> 00:02:45.375
while the moon's light gives coolness.

26
00:02:45.375 --> 00:02:48.708
Both these lights are essential for life on earth.

27
00:02:48.708 --> 00:02:49.541
This light

28
00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:51.833
that illuminates the entire world

29
00:02:51.833 --> 00:02:53.583
is a part of Krishna

30
00:02:53.583 --> 00:02:57.166
and shows His all-pervading form.

31
00:02:57.166 --> 00:03:00.375
Third example – Praņavah sarva-vedeșu –

32
00:03:00.375 --> 00:03:06.041
meaning ‘In all Vedic mantras, I am Om.'

33
00:03:06.041 --> 00:03:08.958
Om is the sacred sound of Vedic literature

34
00:03:08.958 --> 00:03:11.250
and symbol of supreme truth.

35
00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:15.500
Krishna says that He is the Om form.

36
00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:18.125
Meaning the beginning of every Vedic mantra

37
00:03:18.125 --> 00:03:19.291
is remembrance of Him,

38
00:03:19.291 --> 00:03:21.833
His divine expression.

39
00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:24.833
Fourth example – Śabdaḥ khe –

40
00:03:24.833 --> 00:03:28.500
meaning 'I am the sound in space.'

41
00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:32.458
Words need space for transmission.

42
00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:34.708
Krishna says the presence of sound

43
00:03:34.708 --> 00:03:36.666
is the effect of His power,

44
00:03:36.666 --> 00:03:38.250
because of which

45
00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:40.958
the ability to hear and speak is possible.

46
00:03:40.958 --> 00:03:43.583
Fifth example – Pauruṣaṁ nṛṣu –

47
00:03:43.583 --> 00:03:45.208
meaning

48
00:03:45.208 --> 00:03:48.291
'I am the ability in humans.'

49
00:03:48.291 --> 00:03:51.291
Krishna manifests as humans' ability,

50
00:03:51.291 --> 00:03:53.541
power, and capability.

51
00:03:53.541 --> 00:03:56.958
Every action of a human, whether small

52
00:03:56.958 --> 00:03:59.000
or some big achievement,

53
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.583
is a display of Krishna's power.

54
00:04:01.583 --> 00:04:06.625
Sixth example – Puņyo gandhaḥ přthivyām ca –

55
00:04:06.625 --> 00:04:07.583
meaning

56
00:04:07.583 --> 00:04:10.958
'I am the original fragrance of earth.'

57
00:04:10.958 --> 00:04:12.291
The natural fragrance

58
00:04:12.291 --> 00:04:14.333
that arises from earth,

59
00:04:14.333 --> 00:04:17.250
like the smell of soil or the scent of flowers,

60
00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.125
Krishna says this is His form,

61
00:04:20.125 --> 00:04:24.083
which makes our experience
 beautiful in the world.

62
00:04:24.083 --> 00:04:28.083
Seventh example – Tejaś cāsmi vibhāvasau –

63
00:04:28.083 --> 00:04:32.250
meaning 'I am the brilliance of fire.'

64
00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:36.250
The basic element of fire is its brilliance, its heat,

65
00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.708
which is important for warmth,

66
00:04:37.708 --> 00:04:39.333
for cooking food,

67
00:04:39.333 --> 00:04:41.625
for digestion.

68
00:04:41.625 --> 00:04:43.708
This means Krishna is

69
00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:46.083
the original source of this heat,

70
00:04:46.083 --> 00:04:50.916
which is necessary for many natural
 or bodily processes.

71
00:04:50.916 --> 00:04:55.291
Eighth example – Jīvanaṁ sarva-bhūteșu –

72
00:04:55.291 --> 00:04:58.291
meaning 'I am the life in all beings.'

73
00:04:58.291 --> 00:05:01.916
Krishna says that the life-force in all creatures

74
00:05:01.916 --> 00:05:03.791
is His form.

75
00:05:03.791 --> 00:05:05.750
The body is lifeless,

76
00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:07.958
the soul that keeps it alive

77
00:05:07.958 --> 00:05:11.166
is the form of Krishna's divine power.

78
00:05:11.166 --> 00:05:14.708
Ninth example – Tapaś cāsmi tapasvīṣu –

79
00:05:14.708 --> 00:05:18.708
meaning 'I am the austerity of all ascetics.'

80
00:05:18.708 --> 00:05:21.625
Krishna says the ability to practice austerity

81
00:05:21.625 --> 00:05:23.583
is a display of His power.

82
00:05:23.583 --> 00:05:26.291
Ascetics obtain the power to control desires

83
00:05:26.291 --> 00:05:28.125
and endure discomfort

84
00:05:28.125 --> 00:05:30.041
from Him.

85
00:05:30.041 --> 00:05:34.166
Tenth example – Bījam mām sarva-bhūtānām –

86
00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:38.500
meaning 'I am the original seed of all beings.'

87
00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.250
Here bhūtas means

88
00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:42.041
all creatures

89
00:05:42.041 --> 00:05:43.833
and also stable beings

90
00:05:43.833 --> 00:05:47.875
like trees, plants, and many stable creatures.

91
00:05:47.875 --> 00:05:49.500
All creatures of creation

92
00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:51.583
arise from Krishna.

93
00:05:51.583 --> 00:05:53.875
He is present in all

94
00:05:53.875 --> 00:05:55.958
as an eternal seed.

95
00:05:55.958 --> 00:05:59.333
Eleventh example – Buddhir
 buddhimatām asmi –

96
00:05:59.333 --> 00:06:01.041
meaning

97
00:06:01.041 --> 00:06:04.458
'I am the intelligence of the intelligent.'

98
00:06:04.458 --> 00:06:07.791
Knowledge, wisdom, and
 ability to recognize truth

99
00:06:07.791 --> 00:06:10.916
all arise from Krishna.

100
00:06:10.916 --> 00:06:14.125
As the power of intellect and reasoning,

101
00:06:14.125 --> 00:06:17.541
His power is expressed in this world.

102
00:06:17.541 --> 00:06:19.583
Twelfth example –

103
00:06:19.583 --> 00:06:21.708
Tejas tejasvinām aham –

104
00:06:21.708 --> 00:06:25.416
meaning 'I am the brilliance of the brilliant,

105
00:06:25.416 --> 00:06:28.208
the prowess of the powerful.'

106
00:06:28.208 --> 00:06:29.750
Prowess means

107
00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:33.833
power, courage, and ability to become excellent.

108
00:06:33.833 --> 00:06:35.000
Krishna says

109
00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:37.208
that the prowess in the powerful

110
00:06:37.208 --> 00:06:39.000
is His form,

111
00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.875
arises from His power alone.

112
00:06:41.875 --> 00:06:43.458
Thirteenth example –

113
00:06:43.458 --> 00:06:47.041
Balaṁ balavatāṁ cāhaṁ
 kāma-rāga-vivarjitam –

114
00:06:47.041 --> 00:06:49.916
meaning 'I am the strength of the strong,

115
00:06:49.916 --> 00:06:53.833
which is free from lust and attachment.'

116
00:06:53.833 --> 00:06:56.875
Krishna says He is the strength of the strong,

117
00:06:56.875 --> 00:06:58.041
but that strength

118
00:06:58.041 --> 00:07:01.000
which is free from lust and attachment.

119
00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.375
This is pure strength,

120
00:07:02.375 --> 00:07:04.125
which is used for righteous works,

121
00:07:04.125 --> 00:07:05.791
for protection of others,

122
00:07:05.791 --> 00:07:08.750
and for human welfare.

123
00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:09.833
This is certainly not

124
00:07:09.833 --> 00:07:14.750
that strength which is used for
 selfishness or indulgence.

125
00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:15.791
And then,

126
00:07:15.791 --> 00:07:17.666
Fourteenth example –

127
00:07:17.666 --> 00:07:21.166
Dharmāviruddho bhūteṣu kāmo 'smi –

128
00:07:21.166 --> 00:07:24.083
meaning 'I am that desire

129
00:07:24.083 --> 00:07:27.791
which is not at all against dharma.'

130
00:07:27.791 --> 00:07:30.958
Two things need to be understood here.

131
00:07:30.958 --> 00:07:35.750
First, that not all physical desire is bad,

132
00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:39.291
that physical desire which is
 according to dharma,

133
00:07:39.291 --> 00:07:42.583
such as creation of offspring through marriage,

134
00:07:42.583 --> 00:07:44.833
that desire is not only pure,

135
00:07:44.833 --> 00:07:47.375
but is Krishna's form itself.

136
00:07:47.375 --> 00:07:50.125
Here Krishna is also explaining

137
00:07:50.125 --> 00:07:51.333
a big difference between pure desire

138
00:07:51.333 --> 00:07:54.958
and indulgence or unrighteous physical desire.

139
00:07:54.958 --> 00:07:55.791
Through all these examples

140
00:07:55.791 --> 00:07:59.791
from the eighth verse to the eleventh verse,

141
00:07:59.791 --> 00:08:01.208
Krishna shows

142
00:08:01.208 --> 00:08:03.583
that He is not only the creator of creation,

143
00:08:03.583 --> 00:08:05.291
but also the protector

144
00:08:05.291 --> 00:08:07.583
and the basic element of everything.

145
00:08:07.583 --> 00:08:09.291
His existence pervades

146
00:08:09.291 --> 00:08:12.083
the various elements and events of the universe,

147
00:08:12.083 --> 00:08:15.916
which manifests through His diverse powers.

148
00:08:15.916 --> 00:08:16.958
And finally,

149
00:08:16.958 --> 00:08:20.625
in the twelfth verse of the 
seventh chapter, Krishna says

150
00:08:20.625 --> 00:08:24.416
that all material states and the three guṇas

151
00:08:24.416 --> 00:08:26.333
of sattva, rajas, and tamas

152
00:08:26.333 --> 00:08:28.208
also arise from Him.

153
00:08:28.208 --> 00:08:30.958
He says these states have definitely

154
00:08:30.958 --> 00:08:34.708
arisen from Me, but I am not in them.

155
00:08:34.708 --> 00:08:38.000
Meaning He is not affected by them.

156
00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:41.666
These three guṇas of sattva, rajas, and tamas

157
00:08:41.666 --> 00:08:46.041
are under Krishna's control,
 and Krishna is beyond them.

158
00:08:50.583 --> 00:08:54.250
From obtaining complete knowledge,

159
00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:59.250
your perspective completely changes.

160
00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:03.208
Events that seemed ordinary before,

161
00:09:03.208 --> 00:09:04.791
now experience of divinity

162
00:09:04.791 --> 00:09:08.250
begins in them.

163
00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:10.375
Think –

164
00:09:10.375 --> 00:09:14.125
the food is the same, but

165
00:09:14.125 --> 00:09:16.458
if it's known that it's made

166
00:09:16.458 --> 00:09:20.291
by mother's hands,

167
00:09:20.291 --> 00:09:24.833
then how much flavor dissolves
 in that same food.

168
00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:26.958
Similarly,

169
00:09:26.958 --> 00:09:31.583
the water you drink,

170
00:09:31.583 --> 00:09:34.500
I am present in it,

171
00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.000
now this knowledge

172
00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:40.666
will change this ordinary action of yours,

173
00:09:40.666 --> 00:09:43.500
because now by drinking water

174
00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:47.458
you're not only quenching your thirst,

175
00:09:47.458 --> 00:09:52.916
but also absorbing Me within yourself.

176
00:09:52.916 --> 00:09:55.541
Similarly, the light of sun and

177
00:09:55.541 --> 00:09:59.291
moon is seen daily,

178
00:09:59.291 --> 00:10:03.041
and when you know

179
00:10:03.041 --> 00:10:05.166
that this light is also

180
00:10:05.166 --> 00:10:07.666
My form,

181
00:10:07.666 --> 00:10:10.166
then this daily scene also

182
00:10:10.166 --> 00:10:14.916
transforms into a divine moment.

183
00:10:14.916 --> 00:10:17.833
Behind every ordinary event,

184
00:10:17.833 --> 00:10:22.333
there's an extraordinary purpose.

185
00:10:22.333 --> 00:10:24.583
Take this Gita itself.

186
00:10:24.583 --> 00:10:27.500
Perhaps picking up and reading this Gita

187
00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:31.250
started with an ordinary purpose.

188
00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:35.041
But you've come this far.

189
00:10:35.041 --> 00:10:36.208
You're knowing My

190
00:10:36.208 --> 00:10:40.166
and this universe's secret.

191
00:10:40.166 --> 00:10:43.125
And you're also knowing

192
00:10:43.125 --> 00:10:46.041
that whatever good or
 bad is happening in your life,

193
00:10:46.041 --> 00:10:50.208
its purpose is

194
00:10:50.208 --> 00:10:53.500
to help you.

195
00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:56.791
Just think about your own past,

196
00:10:56.791 --> 00:11:00.083
many such events will be found

197
00:11:00.083 --> 00:11:03.458
that you were afraid of,

198
00:11:03.458 --> 00:11:06.083
but you overcame them,

199
00:11:06.083 --> 00:11:10.500
and came out learning
 something new and good.

200
00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:14.125
Reading the Gita

201
00:11:14.125 --> 00:11:16.916
and using this knowledge in your life

202
00:11:16.916 --> 00:11:19.958
will purify your mind

203
00:11:19.958 --> 00:11:22.083
and make every moment of yours

204
00:11:22.083 --> 00:11:26.541
full of My divine presence.

205
00:11:26.541 --> 00:11:30.416
Every circumstance, whether
 happiness or sorrow,

206
00:11:30.416 --> 00:11:33.500
will become such an opportunity

207
00:11:33.500 --> 00:11:36.000
in which by remembering Me

208
00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:39.666
you'll be able to strengthen yourself.

209
00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:46.708
Today in society,

210
00:11:46.708 --> 00:11:48.958
physical relations

211
00:11:48.958 --> 00:11:51.708
have been made so ordinary,

212
00:11:51.708 --> 00:11:55.958
such common promotion of it has been done

213
00:11:55.958 --> 00:11:58.291
that people have forgotten

214
00:11:58.291 --> 00:12:01.916
the purity and importance hidden in it.

215
00:12:01.916 --> 00:12:07.125
The act that was for creation of new life,

216
00:12:07.125 --> 00:12:09.291
today it has become merely

217
00:12:09.291 --> 00:12:12.833
a path for satisfaction of physical desire.

218
00:12:12.833 --> 00:12:15.291
Unrighteous physical desire

219
00:12:15.291 --> 00:12:19.166
starts making life hollow,

220
00:12:19.166 --> 00:12:21.125
after momentary pleasure

221
00:12:21.125 --> 00:12:26.125
starts disturbing the mind.

222
00:12:26.125 --> 00:12:27.833
I am

223
00:12:27.833 --> 00:12:30.125
that desire

224
00:12:30.125 --> 00:12:33.625
which is not at all against dharma.

225
00:12:33.625 --> 00:12:38.166
When physical relations are according to dharma,

226
00:12:38.166 --> 00:12:41.791
are for the purpose of creation of life,

227
00:12:41.791 --> 00:12:44.916
then that same physical relation

228
00:12:44.916 --> 00:12:47.500
becomes pure.

229
00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:50.250
In such righteous relations

230
00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:52.791
My power is present.

231
00:12:52.791 --> 00:12:55.500
Such a relation becomes

232
00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:58.916
an experience of spirituality and divinity.

233
00:12:58.916 --> 00:13:04.208
Fills life with satisfaction.

234
00:13:04.208 --> 00:13:05.166
The purpose of sharing

235
00:13:05.166 --> 00:13:08.541
this knowledge with you is
 neither to condemn people

236
00:13:08.541 --> 00:13:11.500
nor to condemn society,

237
00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:14.833
rather its purpose is only

238
00:13:14.833 --> 00:13:18.083
to place a profound truth before you.

239
00:13:18.083 --> 00:13:19.416
Just as

240
00:13:19.416 --> 00:13:22.708
every action has a higher purpose,

241
00:13:22.708 --> 00:13:26.916
similarly physical desire also has

242
00:13:26.916 --> 00:13:31.750
a higher purpose.

243
00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:34.083
The Gita teaches us

244
00:13:34.083 --> 00:13:37.416
to elevate our understanding,

245
00:13:37.416 --> 00:13:41.875
see purity in every aspect of life,

246
00:13:41.875 --> 00:13:44.166
even in those that

247
00:13:44.166 --> 00:13:47.875
society may consider trivial.

248
00:13:47.875 --> 00:13:50.791
Only then can we truly

249
00:13:50.791 --> 00:13:54.916
live in harmony

250
00:13:54.916 --> 00:13:57.708
with ourselves and others.

251
00:14:02.333 --> 00:14:03.958
At the workplace,

252
00:14:03.958 --> 00:14:07.750
we often think that our success

253
00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:10.416
is only the result of our effort,

254
00:14:10.416 --> 00:14:13.791
intelligence, and ability.

255
00:14:13.791 --> 00:14:15.291
But

256
00:14:15.291 --> 00:14:18.625
remember,

257
00:14:18.625 --> 00:14:22.333
I am that ability

258
00:14:22.333 --> 00:14:24.875
present in humans.

259
00:14:24.875 --> 00:14:28.375
Whatever power, skill,

260
00:14:28.375 --> 00:14:30.958
and capability you have,

261
00:14:30.958 --> 00:14:34.583
it has arisen from My power.

262
00:14:34.583 --> 00:14:37.791
When you adopt this truth,

263
00:14:37.791 --> 00:14:41.625
humility will come automatically.

264
00:14:41.625 --> 00:14:43.708
Then you'll understand

265
00:14:43.708 --> 00:14:47.958
that your talent is not only yours –

266
00:14:47.958 --> 00:14:52.916
there's also divine participation in it.

267
00:14:52.916 --> 00:14:56.250
Where on one hand your pride

268
00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:59.041
will change to humility,

269
00:14:59.041 --> 00:15:02.125
there the purpose of your work

270
00:15:02.125 --> 00:15:05.541
will also now become higher.

271
00:15:05.541 --> 00:15:09.791
In your every success, you'll now start seeing

272
00:15:09.791 --> 00:15:13.791
spirituality and human welfare.

273
00:15:13.791 --> 00:15:16.500
Think –

274
00:15:16.500 --> 00:15:18.083
two people

275
00:15:18.083 --> 00:15:20.791
work at the same position.

276
00:15:20.791 --> 00:15:22.041
The first person

277
00:15:22.041 --> 00:15:23.250
considers their hard work

278
00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:26.458
the only reason for success.

279
00:15:26.458 --> 00:15:28.250
They forget others' help

280
00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:33.000
and fortune's contribution.

281
00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:35.500
The second person is also successful,

282
00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:39.291
but they know that in their capability

283
00:15:39.291 --> 00:15:42.541
there's also divine partnership.

284
00:15:42.541 --> 00:15:45.583
They remain humble and grateful.

285
00:15:45.583 --> 00:15:47.750
Their goal is clear.

286
00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:50.250
They know that their purpose

287
00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:54.083
is not only personal life transformation,

288
00:15:54.083 --> 00:15:57.625
but they're a small part

289
00:15:57.625 --> 00:16:02.250
of a divine plan of human welfare.

290
00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:04.583
Now you tell me,

291
00:16:04.583 --> 00:16:12.666
